+# =============================================================================
+# PACKAGES
+# =============================================================================
+# Broadcast B2 (founder release 2026-10-04, "HaishinKit einschließlich der RTMP/RTMPS-
+# Produkte", for this file and Package.swift). The FIRST external dependency this app links:
+# zero-deps was the default, not a law, and the product law says integrate, never rebuild,
+# specialist infrastructure such as an RTMP muxer and an H.264/AAC encoder pipeline.
+# · Pinned, not `from:` — a broadcast stack is not something to upgrade by surprise. HaishinKit
+#   is pinned to the COMMIT behind tag 2.2.5 (`revision:`): a tag can be re-pointed upstream, a
+#   commit hash cannot, and this is the first package that carries network code into the app.
+#   2.2.5 is the release whose API `Stream/RTMPBroadcastEngine.swift` was written against. To
+#   upgrade, re-derive the hash from the new tag (`git rev-parse <tag>^{commit}` in a clone),
+#   never edit it by hand. Logboard stays `exactVersion:` because HaishinKit's manifest asks
+#   for a 2.6.x VERSION and a revision cannot satisfy a version range.
+# · Licences: HaishinKit and Logboard are both BSD-3-Clause; acknowledged in
+#   `Sources/Echoelmusic/Resources/ThirdPartyNotices.txt`.
+# · Logboard is listed EXPLICITLY although HaishinKit already depends on it: the adapter
+#   imports it to silence the library's console log (it can print the stream key), and an
+#   import should name a dependency the project declares, not one it inherits. The URL is
+#   spelled exactly as in HaishinKit's own manifest so SwiftPM sees one identity, and 2.6.0
+#   sits inside HaishinKit's `2.6.0..<2.7.0` range.
+# · Only the HaishinKit and RTMPHaishinKit products are linked. SRT, MoQ and WebRTC (and the
+#   libsrt / libdatachannel binaries behind them) are NOT, so no SRT claim follows from this.
+packages:
+  HaishinKit:
+    url: https://github.com/HaishinKit/HaishinKit.swift.git
+    revision: dc880cb540b8feeb98f64e8b7dcfaaf320b6b2bd
+  Logboard:
+    url: https://github.com/shogo4405/Logboard.git
+    exactVersion: 2.6.0
+
